# Line endings are LF everywhere, in the index and in the working tree.
#
# This overrides `core.autocrlf`, which Git for Windows sets to `true` in its
# system config, so the rule travels with the repo instead of depending on how
# each machine installed Git. `biome.jsonc` declares `lineEnding: "lf"` and
# reads the working tree, so a CRLF checkout fails `npm run lint` on files
# nobody touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The font sources and the OG reference art: never normalized, never diffed.
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
